WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.990
(computer) Welcome, you can ask about
restaurants, museums,

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.600
and hotels in four cities
in the Orlando area.

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:12.145
Can I see the Chinese
restaurants in Orlando?

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.310
There are 19 Chinese
restaurants in Orlando,

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:21.310
some around East Colonial
Drive, South Kirkman road,

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:22.510
and West Colonial Drive.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:31.270
Can I get the phone
number for Tasty Wok?

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:44.050
The phone number of Tasty Wok
is area code 407-896-8988.

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:47.790
[NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]

